Extreme Parkour terrain adaptation
==================================

This directory contains an Isaac Lab adaptation of terrain-generation code from:

  Extreme Parkour with Legged Robots
  Copyright (c) 2023 Xuxin Cheng, Kexin Shi, Deepak Pathak
  https://github.com/chengxuxin/extreme-parkour

Source revision:
  d2ffe27ba59a3229fad22a9fc94c38010bb1f519
  legged_gym/legged_gym/utils/terrain.py

Changes:
  - Replaced Isaac Gym SubTerrain mutation with Isaac Lab mesh-return interfaces.
  - Added configuration classes, deterministic local random generators, scaling,
    input validation, bounds checking, and tests.
  - Omitted route goals, task observations, rewards, and policy code.

